  designNotes: '2026-09-02, user picked 武士 debug-mode state #8 (Wushi_ChargeCut) + #9
    (ContinuousThrust) to promote into the real pool ("我比較喜歡...8/9動作的展現 請套用回真實模式").
    Wushi_ChargeCut is the same Meshy source family as Wushi_TwistCleave (扭轉前劈) but
    a different export + the debug state runs it at speed 1.15 (which the user prefers).
    Measured offline on the live 4x 武士: real RootT net travel 0.78m (in-place). 3 phases:
    early swing nt 0.13-0.19 (blade reach 3.6, speed 30), the big committed cleave nt
    0.40-0.50 (reach spikes 7.5, speed peak 56, dmgMult 1.15), and a forward extension/
    thrust nt 0.80-0.92 (reach 6.5 -> 8.8). useRootMotion 0 (baked in place). attackId
    CleaveCharge (ChargeCut is taken by SwordJudgment). Replaces Wushi_Attack_TwistCleave
    in the pool (same move, this is the version the user pointed at). Wushi_ChargeCut
    AnimatorState speed stays 1.15. deflectReaction ContinueCombo, knockback 0 per
    session rules. NEEDS PLAY TUNING: hit window nt, damage 30/34.5, the 3rd window.'
